{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1733702400, "end_date": 1734307199, "month_true_total": 709, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:52:50 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "182848900", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110892972", "personaname": "karas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/karas_95/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 4491, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4491, "last_played": 1678522662, "avatar": "5625bc5f765949e87ba08d9b90fd9e15c686bf1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game to play once in a blue moon", "timestamp_created": 1734297616, "timestamp_updated": 1734297616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182838038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198878318913", "personaname": "Silly Twink", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kennysutra/", "num_games_owned": 164, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 276, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 172, "last_played": 1773417860, "avatar": "feab7ac9e08ce1e1b6e249c2741bdc66333fc503"}, "language": "english", "review": "A Thrilling Co-op Zombie Shooter\n\nBack 4 Blood delivers an exhilarating co-op experience that scratches the itch for anyone who loved games like Left 4 Dead. The fast-paced action, intense zombie hordes, and strategic teamwork make every mission feel fresh and engaging.\n\nThe card system is a standout feature, adding a layer of depth and replayability. Building decks to enhance your playstyle or counter the Ridden’s corruption cards keeps the gameplay dynamic and ensures no two runs are the same. Whether you're a fan of high-damage melee builds or prefer a support role for your team, there's something here for everyone.\n\nVisually, the game is stunning, with detailed environments and terrifyingly designed enemies. The atmosphere can go from nerve-wracking tension in a dark tunnel to pure adrenaline as you mow down waves of infected in a frantic firefight. The sound design amplifies the experience, with chilling growls and satisfying weapon feedback.\n\nWhile it’s best enjoyed with friends, the AI companions are competent enough to make solo runs enjoyable too. With regular updates and a steady flow of new content, Back 4 Blood is a fantastic choice for fans of co-op shooters.\n\nHighly recommended for those looking for a thrilling, chaotic, and highly replayable zombie-killing adventure!", "timestamp_created": 1734288143, "timestamp_updated": 1734288143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182825267", "author": {"steamid": "76561199219174224", "personaname": "Mightypoop", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199219174224/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 153, "playtime_forever": 3888, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 556, "last_played": 1735178432, "avatar": "6ad634502de427dfdeedb83b61122b60ba4135a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "knock off L4D2", "timestamp_created": 1734277759, "timestamp_updated": 1734277759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "a